# CogKuraBench agent core

- Read [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md) before making structural, schema or public-API changes.
- After substantive edits, run repository validation (see AGENTS.md).
- Prefer surgical changes. Do not rewrite datasets or documentation wholesale unless asked.
- Do not modify expected results merely to make a backend pass.
- Do not commit or push unless the user asks.
- Keep deterministic execution independent of external APIs.
- Isolate backend-specific dependencies.
